** Live (mid-run) refinement of a model of two materials with different fields, distributed over the
** processes, each holding the nodes of its subdomain only.
**
** Two separate bars, pulled at their right ends: a gradient-enhanced GCDP bar (GC3D20R: displacement
** and nonlocal damage) and a linear-elastic bar (C3D20R: displacement only). The partition puts each
** bar on its own processes, so a process computing the elastic bar holds no node of the nonlocal
** damage field -- until the refinement makes it hold the hanging nodes of the GCDP bar, which every
** process holds. The right element of each bar is refined at the first topology check. It checks
** that
**
**  * the parents of the values of the new nodes are decided alike in a process without a field of
**    the model (hAdaptivity.NewNodeValues), and the nodes it cannot interpolate receive their values
**    (ElementDistribution.completeNodesAwaitingValues);
**  * a node field entry a marker reads at every node (the recovery-error marker, here with a
**    threshold it never reaches) is gathered from processes of which some hold no node of the field;
**
** bit-identical to a serial run.

*material, name=gcdp, id=gcdp
30000.0,    0.15,   13,         47.4,       55,         4.74,       0.85,       0.12,
0.003,      2.0,        1e-6,   15.0,       0.0040,     4,          1.0,        0.99,
0,          0,          0,           3e-9,     1e-4

*material, name=LinearElastic, id=linearelastic
20000.0, 0.2, 2.0e-9

*section, name=sectionGc, material=gcdp, type=solid
gc_all

*section, name=sectionEl, material=linearelastic, type=solid
el_all

*job, name=nedAmrTwoMaterialsJob, domain=3d

*solver, solver=NEDMPI, name=theSolver
courant-number=0.1
output-frequency=20
topology-check-frequency=20

*modelGenerator, generator=boxGen, name=gc
nX      =2
nY      =1
nZ      =1
lX      =20
lY      =10
lZ      =10
elType  =GC3D20R

*modelGenerator, generator=boxGen, name=el
nX      =2
nY      =1
nZ      =1
y0      =30
lX      =20
lY      =10
lZ      =10
elType  =C3D20R

*modelModifier, type=hAdaptivity, name=amrLive
>>marker, type=nodeSet, nSet=gc_right, initialOnly=False
>>marker, type=nodeSet, nSet=el_right, initialOnly=False
>>marker, type=recoveryError, nodeField=nonlocal damage, fieldThreshold=1e30
maxLevel=1

*fieldOutput
>>perNode, elSet=gc_all, field=nonlocal damage, result=U, name=nonlocalDamage
>>perNode, name=RFgc, nSet=gc_left, field=displacement, result=P, f(x)='np.sum(x[:,0])', saveHistory=True
>>perNode, name=RFel, nSet=el_left, field=displacement, result=P, f(x)='np.sum(x[:,0])', saveHistory=True

*output, type=monitor, name=monitor
fieldOutput=RFgc
fieldOutput=RFel

*step, type=adaptiveForExplicitSimulations, solver=theSolver
maxInc=1, minInc=1e-12, maxNumInc=60, maxIter=25, stepLength=1e-3
>>dirichlet, name=fixGc,  nSet=gc_left,  field=displacement, 1=0, 2=0, 3=0
>>dirichlet, name=pullGc, nSet=gc_right, field=displacement, 1=0.05
>>dirichlet, name=fixEl,  nSet=el_left,  field=displacement, 1=0, 2=0, 3=0
>>dirichlet, name=pullEl, nSet=el_right, field=displacement, 1=0.05
